---
import MainGridLayout from "@/layouts/MainGridLayout.astro";

interface Props {
	lang?: string;
}

const { lang = Astro.url.pathname.startsWith("/en") ? "en" : "zh_CN" } =
	Astro.props;
const isEn = lang === "en";

const title = isEn
	? "FRAGILE BITS · Quantum Error Correction Record"
	: "一错万钧 · FRAGILE BITS";
const description = isEn
	? "On 21 October 2026, Quantinuum's trapped-ion quantum computer Helios set a quantum error-correction record: 99.9995% logical fidelity (five errors per million operations). Quantum bits forget constantly, and making them remember costs qubits — this page makes that cost and payoff visceral."
	: "2026 年 10 月 21 日，Quantinuum 离子阱量子计算机 Helios 创下量子纠错新纪录：99.9995% 逻辑保真度（百万次操作仅 5 次错误）。量子比特时刻在遗忘，而让它们记住需要巨大的物理比特代价——本页将这一代价与回报直观具象化。";
---

<MainGridLayout title={title} description={description} lang={lang}>
	<div class="flex w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden relative min-h-32 mb-8">
		<div class="z-10 px-4 sm:px-8 py-8 relative w-full rounded-(--radius-large) overflow-hidden bg-[#040714] text-slate-100 border border-slate-800/80 shadow-2xl selection:bg-cyan-500/30 selection:text-cyan-200">
			<!-- Ambient Quantum Energy Glows -->
			<div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(#06b6d4_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:28px_28px] overflow-hidden"></div>
			<div class="absolute -top-36 -left-36 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan-600/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute top-1/3 -right-32 w-96 h-96 bg-purple-600/15 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>
			<div class="absolute bottom-16 left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-600/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

			<!-- HERO HEADER SECTION -->
			<header class="relative z-10 mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-slate-800/80">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-mono font-semibold tracking-wide">
							<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-pulse"></span>
							<span>QUANTINUUM · HELIOS QEC RECORD · 2026-10-21</span>
						</div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-purple-500/10 border border-purple-500/30 text-purple-300 text-xs font-mono">
							<span>⚡</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">99.9995% 逻辑保真度 (5 / 1,000,000)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">99.9995% Logical Fidelity (5 in 1M)</span>
						</div>
						<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-300 text-xs font-mono">
							<span>⚛️</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">离子阱色码纠错 · 37:1 物理冗余</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Trapped-Ion Color Code · 37:1 Redundancy</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- In-Page Language Switcher -->
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-slate-400 hidden sm:block">
							<span class="lang-zh">全球量子纠错基准 · 2026-10-21</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Global QEC Benchmark · 2026-10-21</span>
						</div>
						<a
							id="inpage-lang-toggle"
							href={isEn ? "/projects/fragile-bits/" : "/en/projects/fragile-bits/"}
							class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-cyan-500/40 text-cyan-300 hover:text-white hover:bg-cyan-950/60 font-mono text-xs transition cursor-pointer active:scale-95"
							title={isEn ? "切换为中文" : "Switch to English"}
						>
							<svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
								<path d="m12.87 15.07-2.54-2.51.03-.03A17.52 17.52 0 0 0 14.07 6H17V4h-7V2H8v2H1v2h11.17C11.5 7.92 10.44 9.75 9 11.35 8.07 10.32 7.3 9.19 6.69 8h-2c.73 1.63 1.73 3.17 2.98 4.56l-5.09 5.02L4 19l5-5 3.11 3.11.76-2.04zM18.5 10h-2L12 22h2l1.12-3h4.75L21 22h2l-4.5-12zm-2.62 7 1.62-4.33L19.12 17h-3.24z"/>
							</svg>
							<span class="lang-zh font-bold">English</span>
							<span class="lang-en font-bold">中文</span>
						</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-white mb-2 font-sans">
					<span class="lang-zh">一错万钧 · FRAGILE BITS</span>
					<span class="lang-en">FRAGILE BITS · Quantum Error Correction</span>
				</h1>

				<p class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-cyan-400 mb-4 tracking-wide font-mono">
					<span class="lang-zh">计算史上最昂贵的拼写纠错：量子比特时刻在遗忘，让它们记住需要巨大的比特代价。</span>
					<span class="lang-en">The most expensive spellcheck in computing history: qubits forget constantly; making them remember costs qubits.</span>
				</p>

				<div class="space-y-3 max-w-3xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed text-sm sm:text-base">
					<p>
						<span class="lang-zh">
							<strong>2026 年 10 月 21 日</strong>，量子计算领军企业 Quantinuum 正式公布了其新一代离子阱量子计算机<strong>“Helios”</strong>创下的里程碑式量子纠错记录：实现高达 <strong>99.9995% 的逻辑保真度</strong>——即在每百万次逻辑量子门操作中，仅发生<strong>五次错误（five errors per million operations）</strong>！
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							On <strong>21 October 2026</strong>, quantum computing company Quantinuum announced a record-setting quantum error-correction benchmark achieved on its trapped-ion quantum computer <strong>"Helios"</strong>: <strong>99.9995% logical fidelity</strong> — equivalent to just <strong>five errors per million operations</strong>.
						</span>
					</p>
					<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400">
						<span class="lang-zh">
							这一突破展现了极为惊人的技术演进斜率：与 Quantinuum 自身在 2026 年 9 月发布的“Helix”方案相比，错误率在短短一个月内实现了<strong>整整十倍（10×）的削减</strong>；据 Quantinuum 报告，该保真度相比于竞品硬件路线已发表的最强成果更实现了<strong>一百倍（100×）的断层式领先</strong>。9 月的 Helix 方案使用 10 个物理比特来守护 1 个逻辑比特，而本次实验则引入了复杂的色码（Color Code）架构，使用多达 <strong>37 个物理离子比特</strong>来保护 1 个逻辑比特——以更大的物理硬件消耗，换取了断崖式下降的错误率。同时，实验观测到了严格的指数级纠错扩展规律：代码距离每前进一步，逻辑错误抑制倍率便提升 <strong>12 倍</strong>。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							This represents a steep engineering trajectory: a tenfold (10×) reduction in Quantinuum's own error rate in just one month since September, and — per Quantinuum — a hundredfold (100×) improvement over the strongest published result from competing hardware approaches. September's "Helix" system used 10 physical qubits to protect each logical qubit. The Helios experiment deployed a color code with up to <strong>37 physical qubits per logical qubit</strong> — directly trading greater physical resource consumption for substantially lower logical error rates. Crucially, increasing code distance reduced logical errors exponentially: each tested step improved error suppression by a <strong>factor of 12</strong>.
						</span>
					</p>
					<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400">
						<span class="lang-zh">
							量子比特时刻面临退相干与环境噪声侵袭，未经纠错的量子算法往往在触及复杂计算前便沦为随机乱码；容错量子纠错正是通用量子计算必须矗立其上的坚实地基。Quantinuum 将这一成果与其计划于 <strong>2029 年推出的通用容错量子计算系统“Apollo”</strong>直接挂钩（公司公布的目标规划，非既成事实）。
						</span>
						<span class="lang-en">
							Qubits lose coherence constantly and physical operations inject noise, derailing calculations long before complex algorithms finish; quantum error correction is the foundational bedrock on which practical quantum computing must be built. Quantinuum links these results to <strong>"Apollo," its planned universal fault-tolerant system targeted for 2029</strong> (the company's stated development target, not a verified fact).
						</span>
					</p>
				</div>
			</header>

			<!-- CORE FACTS METRICS STRIP -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-10">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
					<span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
						<span class="lang-zh">核心突破指标 · KEY BENCHMARK STRIP</span>
						<span class="lang-en">CORE BENCHMARK METRICS STRIP</span>
					</span>
				</div>
				<div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-3 text-xs font-mono">
					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-cyan-500/30">
						<div class="text-cyan-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">逻辑保真度</span>
							<span class="lang-en">LOGICAL FIDELITY</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-white mt-1">99.9995%</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">5 / 1,000,000 操作错误</span>
							<span class="lang-en">5 errors / 1M operations</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-purple-500/30">
						<div class="text-purple-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">月度进步幅度</span>
							<span class="lang-en">1-MONTH LEAP</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-purple-300 mt-1">10× 降错</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">相比 9 月 Helix 方案</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Tenfold vs Sept Helix</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-amber-500/30">
						<div class="text-amber-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">竞品比较领先</span>
							<span class="lang-en">COMPETITIVE LEAD</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-amber-300 mt-1">100× 优势</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">优于竞品已发表成果 (Quantinuum称)</span>
							<span class="lang-en">vs published rivals (Quantinuum)</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-emerald-500/30">
						<div class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">色码物理冗余</span>
							<span class="lang-en">CODE REDUNDANCY</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-emerald-300 mt-1">37 : 1</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">最多37物理离子/逻辑比特</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Up to 37 ions / logical bit</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-indigo-500/30">
						<div class="text-indigo-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">距离扩展抑制率</span>
							<span class="lang-en">DISTANCE SCALING</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-indigo-300 mt-1">÷ 12 / 阶梯</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">每步错误下降12倍</span>
							<span class="lang-en">12× suppression per step</span>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-rose-500/30">
						<div class="text-rose-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">
							<span class="lang-zh">通用容错路线</span>
							<span class="lang-en">ROADMAP TARGET</span>
						</div>
						<div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black text-rose-300 mt-1">2029 Apollo</div>
						<div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">
							<span class="lang-zh">Quantinuum规划目标</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Company stated target</span>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- REALITY CHECK STRIP (NON-INTERACTIVE HONESTY NOTES) -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-12 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/90 border border-rose-500/40 text-slate-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 text-rose-400 font-mono font-bold tracking-wider uppercase text-sm">
					<span>⚖️</span>
					<span class="lang-zh">现实审视与科学诚实性声明 (REALITY CHECK)</span>
					<span class="lang-en">REALITY CHECK & SCIENTIFIC HONESTY STRIP</span>
				</div>
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs font-mono">
					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-amber-400 font-bold mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
							<span>⚠️</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">1. 单项逻辑操作纪录 ≠ 商业实用算法稳定运行数小时</span>
							<span class="lang-en">1. Record Logical Op ≠ Useful Algorithm Run for Hours</span>
						</div>
						<p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-sans">
							<span class="lang-zh">
								在实验受控基准测试中跑出高保真度的单个或级联逻辑门，与在实际大规模量子算法（例如 Shor 质因数分解或长时分子量子化学模拟）中持续调度成百上千个纠错比特并无间断运行数小时，存在着巨大的系统工程与软硬件鸿沟。
							</span>
							<span class="lang-en">
								Demonstrating high fidelity on isolated benchmark operations is fundamentally different from sustaining thousands of coordinated logical gates across hundreds of logical qubits running commercially useful algorithms for uninterrupted hours.
							</span>
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-cyan-400 font-bold mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
							<span>⚠️</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">2. 单一硬件架构成功 ≠ 全方位性能指标全胜</span>
							<span class="lang-en">2. Trapped-Ion Success ≠ Superiority Across Every Metric</span>
						</div>
						<p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-sans">
							<span class="lang-zh">
								离子阱硬件在两比特门保真度与全连通性（All-to-All Connectivity）上表现卓绝，但在门操作速度（微秒到毫秒级，比超导慢数个数量级）、离子穿梭延迟、芯片制造与极低温/超高真空封装成本上均面临独立且严峻的挑战。
							</span>
							<span class="lang-en">
								While trapped ions exhibit superior native gate fidelities and all-to-all connectivity via ion shuttling, superconducting and other architectures maintain significant advantages in raw gate speeds (nanoseconds vs microseconds) and scalable semiconductor manufacturing.
							</span>
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-purple-400 font-bold mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
							<span>📐</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">3. 所有图表均为概念示意图，非实验室实测波形</span>
							<span class="lang-en">3. All Diagrams Are Schematic / Illustrative Models</span>
						</div>
						<p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-sans">
							<span class="lang-zh">
								本页面呈现的“遗忘的量子比特”波形、“百万分之五”点阵、“色码晶格点”以及“十二倍抑制曲线”均为用于原理解释与交互教学的<strong>概念性示意图解（illustrative / schematic）</strong>，绝非 Quantinuum 实验室硬件实测摄影或原始实验波形数据。
							</span>
							<span class="lang-en">
								All visual simulations, dot matrices, color-code lattices, and suppression curves on this page are <strong>schematic illustrations</strong> clearly labeled as such for intuitive pedagogical understanding — they are NOT Quantinuum hardware imagery or raw laboratory traces.
							</span>
						</p>
					</div>

					<div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800">
						<div class="text-emerald-400 font-bold mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
							<span>🔭</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">4. 真正的终极突破：当纠错不再成为头条新闻</span>
							<span class="lang-en">4. The Real Turning Point: Invisible Infrastructure</span>
						</div>
						<p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed font-sans">
							<span class="lang-zh">
								量子计算历史上真正的奇点，绝不会发生在某一次刷屏的单项保真度纪录破榜之日，而是发生当量子纠错彻底从所有科技头条新闻中淡出、蜕变成为如同现代经典计算机内存 ECC 一样令人心安且无感的<strong>隐形基础设施</strong>之时。
							</span>
							<span class="lang-en">
								The true watershed in quantum computing will arrive not when a single fidelity record makes headlines, but when quantum error correction ceases to be news at all — fading into boring, reliable, invisible background infrastructure just like DRAM ECC in modern classical servers.
							</span>
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- ============================================================== -->
			<!-- INTERACTIVE 1: THE FORGETFUL QUBIT (DECOHERENCE PLAYGROUND)   -->
			<!-- ============================================================== -->
			<section class="relative z-10 mb-14 p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
				<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4">
					<div>
						<div class="text-xs font-mono text-cyan-400 uppercase tracking-widest font-bold flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
							<span>⏳</span>
							<span class="lang-zh">交互实验 01 · 遗忘的量子比特</span>
							<span class="lang-en">INTERACTIVE 01 · THE FORGETFUL QUBIT</span>
						</div>
						<h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-white tracking-tight">
							<span class="lang-zh">退相干游乐场：没有纠错，量子计算何时崩溃？</span>
							<span class="lang-en">Decoherence Playground: When Does Uncorrected Computation Fail?</span>
						</h2>
					</div>
					<div class="text-xs font-mono px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/80 border border-cyan-500/40 text-cyan-300">
						<span class="lang-zh">公式：P(失败) ≈ 1 - (1 - p)ⁿ</span>
						<span class="lang-en">Formula: P(fail) ≈ 1 - (1 - p)ⁿ</span>
					</div>
				</div>

				<p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 mb-6 max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
					<span class="lang-zh">
						单个物理量子比特极其脆弱。即使单次操作的物理错误率仅有 0.1%（千分之一），当算法连续执行数百上千步门操作后，累积错误概率将迅速逼近 100%，整个量子计算将坍缩为毫无意义的随机噪声。拖动下方滑块，对比未纠错物理比特与 Helios 纠错逻辑比特的命运。
					</span>
					<span class="lang-en">
						Physical qubits are extraordinarily brittle. Even with a seemingly minuscule physical error rate of 0.1% per gate, running an algorithm of a few thousand gates causes cumulative failure probability to approach 100%. Adjust the sliders below to contrast an uncorrected physical qubit against the Helios logical qubit.
					</span>
				</p>

				<!-- Controls Grid -->
				<div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 mb-6">
					<!-- Slider Controls (Left 6 cols) -->
					<div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-5 p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/60 border border-slate-800">
						<div>
							<div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs font-mono mb-2">
								<span class="text-slate-300 font-bold">
									<span class="lang-zh">连续门操作步数 (n)：</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Operation Count (n):</span>
								</span>
								<span id="qubit-ops-val" class="text-cyan-400 font-black text-sm">5,000 步</span>
							</div>
							<input id="slider-qubit-ops" type="range" min="100" max="1000000" step="100" value="5000" class="w-full accent-cyan-400 cursor-pointer" />
							<div class="flex justify-between text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-500 mt-1">
								<span>100</span>
								<span>1,000</span>
								<span>10,000</span>
								<span>100,000</span>
								<span>1,000,000</span>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div>
							<div class="flex justify-between items-center text-xs font-mono mb-2">
								<span class="text-slate-300 font-bold">
									<span class="lang-zh">假定物理单门错误率 (p)：</span>
									<span class="lang-en">Assumed Physical Error Rate (p):</span>
